0" end="00:21.162">in </span><span begin="00:21.162" end="00:21.516">the </span><span begin="00:21.516" end="00:22.987">morning </span><span begin="00:22.987" end="00:23.497">when </span><span begin="00:23.497" end="00:23.803">you </span><span begin="00:23.803" end="00:24.057">wake</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.909" end="00:30.950"><span begin="00:25.909" end="00:26.417">Maybe </span><span begin="00:26.417" end="00:28.157">tomorrow </span><span begin="00:28.157" end="00:28.412">we're </span><span begin="00:28.412" end="00:29.886">okay </span><span begin="00:29.886" end="00:30.090">when </span><span begin="00:30.090" end="00:30.292">it's </span><span begin="00:30.292" end="00:30.494">a </span><span begin="00:30.494" end="00:30.697">sunny </span><span begin="00:30.697" end="00:30.950">day</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.101" end="00:35.452"><span begin="00:31.101" end="00:31.304">I </span><span begin="00:31.304" end="00:31.964">keep </span><span begin="00:31.964" end="00:32.474">you </span><span begin="00:32.474" end="00:33.286">posted </span><span begin="00:33.286" end="00:33.542">I </span><span begin="00:33.542" end="00:34.688">promise </span><span begin="00:34.688" end="00:34.892">I'm </span><span begin="00:34.892" end="00:35.452">better</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.452" end="00:40.393"><span begin="00:35.452" end="00:35.812">With </span><span begin="00:35.812" end="00:36.117">the </span><span begin="00:36.117" end="00:36.524">sun </span><span begin="00:36.524" end="00:37.221">we'll </span><span begin="00:37.221" end="00:37.526">leave </span><span begin="00:37.526" end="00:37.731">my </span><span begin="00:37.731" end="00:38.516">house </span><span begin="00:38.516" end="00:38.718">I'm </span><span begin="00:38.718" end="00:39.632">sorry </span><span begin="00:39.632" end="00:39.885">for </span><span begin="00:39.885" end="00:40.393">yesterday</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.211" end="00:45.403"><span begin="00:41.211" end="00:41.697">You </span><span begin="00:41.697" end="00:41.900">know </span><span begin="00:41.900" end="00:42.204">I </span><span begin="00:42.204" end="00:42.457">don't </span><span begin="00:42.457" end="00:42.710">mean </span><span begin="00:42.710" end="00:43.417">it </span><span begin="00:43.417" end="00:43.675">I </span><span begin="00:43.675" end="00:44.796">promise </span><span begin="00:44.796" end="00:45.098">I'm </span><span begin="00:45.098" end="00:45.403">better</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.968" end="00:50.797"><span begin="00:45.968" end="00:46.225">With </span><span begin="00:46.225" end="00:46.479">the </span><span begin="00:46.479" end="00:46.886">sun </span><span begin="00:46.886" end="00:47.492">we'll </span><span begin="00:47.492" end="00:47.846">leave </span><span begin="00:47.846" end="00:48.100">my </span><span begin="00:48.100" end="00:48.765">house </span><span begin="00:48.765" end="00:48.968">I'm </span><span begin="00:48.968" end="00:50.038">sorry </span><span begin="00:50.038" end="00:50.241">for </span><span begin="00:50.241" end="00:50.797">yesterday</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.710" end="00:54.457"><span begin="00:51.710" end="00:52.677">Keep </span><span begin="00:52.677" end="00:53.951">me </span><span begin="00:53.951" end="00:54.457">here</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.386" end="01:00.089"><span begin="00:56.386" end="00:56.589">With </span><span begin="00:56.589" end="00:57.096">your </span><span begin="00:57.096" end="00:58.972">skin </span><span begin="00:58.972" end="00:59.173">on </span><span begin="00:59.173" end="00:59.886">mine </span><span begin="00:59.886" end="01:00.089">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.105" end="01:05.001"><span begin="01:02.105" end="01:02.969">While </span><span begin="01:02.969" end="01:04.034">you're </span><span begin="01:04.034" end="01:05.001">there</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.578" end="01:10.192"><span begin="01:06.578" end="01:06.780">It's </span><span begin="01:06.780" end="01:09.174">easy </span><span begin="01:09.174" end="01:09.378">if </span><span begin="01:09.378" end="01:09.988">I </span><span begin="01:09.988" end="01:10.192">pretend</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.439" end="01:28.543"><span begin="01:23.439" end="01:23.640">Don't </span><span begin="01:23.640" end="01:23.843">know </span><span begin="01:23.843" end="01:24.047">why </span><span begin="01:24.047" end="01:24.250">I </span><span begin="01:24.250" end="01:24.455">feel </span><span begin="01:24.455" end="01:24.662">this </span><span begin="01:24.662" end="01:25.798">way </span><span begin="01:25.798" end="01:26.357">treating </span><span begin="01:26.357" end="01:26.560">all </span><span begin="01:26.560" end="01:26.715">my </span><span begin="01:26.715" end="01:26.919">friends </span><span begin="01:26.919" end="01:27.122">the </span><span begin="01:27.122" end="01:28.543">same</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.543" end="01:32.400"><span begin="01:28.543" end="01:28.747">Haven't </span><span begin="01:28.747" end="01:28.950">had </span><span begin="01:28.950" end="01:29.303">enough </span><span begin="01:29.303" end="01:29.556">to </span><span begin="01:29.556" end="01:30.982">do </span><span begin="01:30.982" end="01:31.186">but </span><span begin="01:31.186" end="01:31.389">I'm </span><span begin="01:31.389" end="01:31.643">not </span><span begin="01:31.643" end="01:32.148">ignoring </span><span begin="01:32.148" end="01:32.400">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.108" end="01:36.172"><span begin="01:33.108" end="01:33.310">Call </span><span begin="01:33.310" end="01:33.971">in </span><span begin="01:33.971" end="01:34.292">the </span><span begin="01:34.292" end="01:35.154">morning </span><span begin="01:35.154" end="01:35.615">when </span><span begin="01:35.615" end="01:35.918">you </span><span begin="01:35.918" end="01:36.172">wake</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.120" end="01:43.659"><s